#Burgeons: ~50% Albedo, ~15% Nahida, ~20% Bennett, ~15% untriggered (Bloom DMG). Partial APL quickswapping between Nahida and Albedo. Energy drops based on 12-3 pizza cutters; Customized random frame delays.

